          "range": "100'",
          "type": "F",
          "subType": "m",
          "attack_table": "",
          "skillName": "",
          "description": "[RR Mod: -20] Up to three targets will incorrectly identify the caster as someone else (all three will describe the caster in the same fashion)."
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "04. Cloaking III",
        "img": "systems/rmss/assets/default/spell.svg",
