          "level": 4,
          "area_of_effect": "3 targets",
          "duration": "1 min/lvl(C)",
          "range": "10'/lvl",
          "type": "F",
          "subType": "m",
          "attack_table": "",
          "skillName": "",
          "description": "[RR Mod: -50] The caster is invisible to the targets of this spell. Others see the caster normally. If the caster makes an obvious action (e.g., talking, moving an object, etc.), the target may make another RR (the GM may deem it appropriate to apply modifiers based upon the action the caster takes). If the caster attacks the target, he may make another RR with a special +50 modifier. If the caster begins to concentrate, he can extend the duration of this spell indefinitely (as long as he can concentrate)."
        }
